    {
      "id": "s-title",
      "type": "title",
      "label": "THE SHOP",
      "sun": 38,
      "eyebrow": "SCENIC FABRICATION · TORONTO",
      "name": "SHOPS",
      "tagline": "Currently taking commissions",
      "paragraphs": [
        "We build the things a camera is willing to believe. Flats, facades, breakaways, rigs, and the occasional object that has no business existing — cut, joined, painted, and trucked to set on the morning it is needed.",
        "Timber, steel, foam, resin, and whatever the art director dreamed up at two in the morning. A set is a lie that has to hold weight; that is the whole job."
      ],
